      "writtenOn": "2023-10-03T18:27:13Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think it is best to move the functionality to a new file/module for clarity, e.g. `le_scanning_decrypter.cc`.\n\nThe module would expose a single method: `ExtractEncryptedData` /  `ProcessEncryptedData` (other ?) with prototype:\n\n```\n/// Iterate over the advertising data, and attempts to decrypt \n/// Encrypted Data AD types using the provided key material.\n/// Aggregates the decrypted data into decrypted_advertising_data, returns\n/// true if all encrypted data was successfully decrypted, false if any\n/// Encrypted Data could not be read.\nbool ExtractEncryptedData(\n    std::vector\u003cuint8_t\u003e const\u0026 advertising_data, \n    std::vector\u003cuint8_t\u003e const\u0026 key_material,\n    std::vector\u003cuint8_t\u003e* decrypted_advertising_data);\n```\n\nThis method would be invoked in le_scanning_manager.cc when the reassembler returns a complete advertisement.",
      "parentUuid": "d314cd71_4e3ae858",
      "revId": "c02b8f936ca78139a8326402982887bfbd21b03d",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
